e scoring and are re-ranked when research finishes. On 7 November 2026, the live energy-drink flow returned three competitors and three source-linked campaign findings. Their dates or station locations were unknown, so none lowered the gap scores. The production sample fallback showed three recorded competitors and its capture-date label; a different brief received no recorded findings. Both browser flows had no console errors. Verified in `2a85115`. Verified on 8 November 2026 in commit `Show competitor logos in the list and on campaign markers`: web lint, typecheck, build and all 26 tests passed, and the logo endpoint returned a PNG for each of the sample run's three competitors. The logos were not checked in a browser. Serves G-Research and HRT.
